   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
            <pb n="1" facs="Edgeworth_Princeton_ME-to-Unknown_page01.jpg"/>
            <p>for 3 - And this minute
               are<lb/> coming<persName ref="./Personography.xml#MurpX1">M<hi rend="superscript"
                     >r</hi> Murphy</persName> &amp; <persName ref="./Personography.xml#BishK1">M<hi
                     rend="superscript">r</hi> Knox<lb/> Bishops</persName>
               <persName ref="./Personography.xml#BishX1">2<hi rend="superscript">d</hi>
                  son</persName> to dinner</p>

            <p>Is it possible that I have<lb/> again forgotten to mention<lb/>
               <persName ref="./Personography.xml#EdgeF1" cert="medium">Francis Es</persName>
               portraits<lb/> I have been so full of them! And<lb/> admire them both so very
               much<lb/> The most smiling is that I<lb/> like the best - <hi rend="underline"
                  >That</hi> one would<lb/> speak the best - and I should<lb/> not wonder if it did
               speak<lb/> &amp; like <persName ref="./Personography.xml#EdgeF1" cert="medium"
                  >Francis</persName> - <del>af</del> not <unclear>fasting</unclear></p>

            <p>But the other would think<lb/> the deepest and like <persName
                  ref="./Personography.xml#EdgeF1" cert="medium">Francis</persName><lb/> fasting to
               whom you might<lb/> appeal for judgement assumed<lb/> some of his own paradoxes<lb/>
               or Platonisms</p>
            <closer> Ever affectionately yours<lb/>
               <persName ref="./Personography.xml#EdgeM1">Maria Edgeworth</persName><lb/>
            </closer>
            <postscript>
               <p><persName ref="./Personography.xml#RuxtM2">Margaret Ruxton</persName> shall
                  have<lb/> the consolation of your<lb/> kind feelings for her</p>
            </postscript>
            <pb n="2" facs="Edgeworth_Princeton_ME-to-Unknown_page02.jpg"/>
            <note place="bottom">15 Jan 38</note>
         </div>
      </body>
      <back> </back>
   </text>
